{"id":"vod_jy_106197","vodId":"106197","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"机动战士高达铁血的奥尔芬斯第一季","name_cn":"机动战士高达铁血的奥尔芬斯第一季","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第25集完结","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/e28fbf78474e81cf5246e15a4097f6ba.jpg"},"summary":"曾经有一场被称作“厄祭战”的大型战争。那场战争终结后过了大约300年。\n　　地球圈失去了至今为止的统治机构，在新的支配体系下，新世界被构筑起来。一时的和平到来，与此同时，远离地球的火星圈燃起了新战争的火种。\n　　主人公——少年三日月·奥古斯，从所属的民间警备公司克律塞安保公司（下称CGS）那里，接受了打算让在地球势力统治下的火星都市独立的少女库德莉亚·蓝那·伯恩斯坦的护卫任务。但，CGS受到摘取反叛之芽的武力组织加拉尔霍恩的袭击，于是在把三日月这些孩子当做诱饵后撤退了。少年们的领袖，奥尔加·伊兹卡认为这是个机会，并决定对虐待自己的大人们掀起反旗。被奥尔加托付击退加拉尔霍恩的三日月，利用被当做CGS动力炉来使用的“厄祭战”时代的机动战士——高达·巴巴托斯，向敌军发起挑战。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-03-23 12:30:03","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/egJLD9kd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/eER9XVYa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/egJLD9Gd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/e312rmOb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/av2ox60a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/e9rQAvBa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bmZQ0W9d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bo2QngBa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bo2QngXa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dNk9KoDe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bW67KAQa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dBBLXGkd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/axkvzr3e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/e5y9wz8e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/e73Lyxye/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bkR